  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Assume,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>So, coordinate of any point on the line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/838ead61-a527-4c62-9641-eb58dc17364f-image.png\" style=\"width: 243px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;is the foot of the perpendicular,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the coordinate of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/323601d4-16f5-4c1f-81d3-53a46178892f-image.png\" style=\"width: 307px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Assume, the coordinate of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, the coordinate of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfenced><mfenced><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
